ng with  conflicting views and challenging my own  beliefs so that when i come to a  conclusion i know exactly why i feel the  way i do  some of the episodes i'll be talking to  you guys by myself sharing all the  things on a particular subject that  massively has improved my life  and some of the episodes i'll be sitting  down and having conversations with some  really knowledgeable inspiring people  you guys i am  so excited and over the moon about it i  can't even tell you how excited i am  to ask those burning questions and hear  perspectives from such knowledgeable  people these episodes range from  plant-based doctors and nutritionists to  thought leaders around the world to your  favorite inspiring people online to my  sister or best friend down the road with  a moving story to share  every episode will be filled with  valuable and important information so  come to this podcast to restore your  health and relationships  be inspired and empowered in ways that  impact not only you but others and the  world around you  and along the way possibly gain some new  perspectives you have never considered  before  each episode is going to be both  recorded and filmed so you can watch the  episodes here on the ellen fisher  podcast channel  or simply listen on the apple podcast or  spotify app please hit that subscribe  button so you never miss an episode and  i cannot wait to start sharing these  episodes with you  [Music]
 

